Neon containers port (M1), part 4 of 7: browser service.

The per-profile ContainersService keyed service from brave-core v1.100.58
(bd6d26d1), its delegate (orphaned container cleanup) and the tab tracker
that marks containers as used and keeps the container id on discarded tabs.
Registered with the profile keyed services and TabFeatures, where Brave uses
its own subclasses.

